answer.worked:
$$\begin{align*}
4^x&=\frac{5^x}{5}\\
\left(\frac54\right)^x&=5\\
x\ln\!\left(\frac54\right)&=\ln 5\\
x&=\frac{\ln 5}{\ln(5/4)}
\end{align*}$$

